  data: {
    LLM: 'Try to maintain cards in multiple suits to avoid being forced to draw. Play high cards early to win tricks and control the lead. When you have the lead, choose suits where you have strength.\n\nPay attention to which suits opponents are struggling with. If you notice a player passing on a suit, they may be accumulating cards - consider leading that suit to force them to draw more.\n\nCard counting is valuable - track which high cards have been played. If you know the King and Horse of a suit have been played, your Maid becomes the highest card. Balance winning tricks (to control the lead) against playing cards quickly.',
    Player: 'Try to maintain cards in multiple suits to avoid being forced to draw. Play high cards early to win tricks and control the lead. When you have the lead, choose suits where you have strength.\n\nPay attention to which suits opponents are struggling with. If you notice a player passing on a suit, they may be accumulating cards - consider leading that suit to force them to draw more.\n\nCard counting is valuable - track which high cards have been played. If you know the King and Horse of a suit have been played, your Maid becomes the highest card. Balance winning tricks (to control the lead) against playing cards quickly.',
